<h2><b>Publish Data</b></h2>

<p>Publishing a dataverse collection and dataset make them viewable and searchable by others.</p>

<div data-darkreader-inline-bgcolor="" data-darkreader-inline-bgimage="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" style="background: rgb(238, 238, 238); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 5px 10px; --darkreader-inline-bgimage: initial; --darkreader-inline-bgcolor: var(--darkreader-background-eeeeee, #303235); --darkreader-inline-border-top: var(--darkreader-border-cccccc, #575f62); --darkreader-inline-border-right: var(--darkreader-border-cccccc, #575f62); --darkreader-inline-border-bottom: var(--darkreader-border-cccccc, #575f62); --darkreader-inline-border-left: var(--darkreader-border-cccccc, #575f62);">Once you publish a dataset, it <b>cannot</b> be unpublished.&nbsp;</div>

<hr />
<h4><b>Publish a dataverse collection</b></h4>

<ol>
	<li>Go to your dataverse collection</li>
	<li>On the right side, click <strong>Publish<br />
	<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://d1qywhc7l90rsa.cloudfront.net/accounts/159013/images/publish-dataverse-1-new.png" style="width: 600px; height: 200px;" /></strong></li>
	<li>In the pop-up window, click&nbsp;<strong>Continue</strong><br />
	<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://d1qywhc7l90rsa.cloudfront.net/accounts/159013/images/publish-dataverse-2.png" style="width: 600px; height: 154px;" /></li>
	<li>You should see a banner showing &#39;<strong>Success! &ndash; Your dataverse is now public.</strong>&#39; message once the dataverse collection is published.<br />
	<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://d1qywhc7l90rsa.cloudfront.net/accounts/159013/images/publish-dataverse-3-new.jpeg" style="width: 600px; height: 226px;" /></li>
</ol>

<hr />
<h4><b>Publish a dataset</b></h4>

<ol>
	<li>Go to your dataset</li>
	<li>On the right side, click <strong>Publish Dataset</strong><br />
	<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://d1qywhc7l90rsa.cloudfront.net/accounts/159013/images/publish-1.png" style="width: 600px; height: 282px;" /></li>
	<li>In the pop-up window, fill in the <strong>Version Note</strong> (optional)</li>
	<li>Click <strong>Continue</strong><br />
	<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://d1qywhc7l90rsa.cloudfront.net/accounts/159013/images/publish-dataset-2-new.png" style="width: 600px; height: 201px;" /></li>
	<li>You should see the &#39;Version 1.0&#39; tag appear on the left side&nbsp;once the dataset is successfully published.<br />
	<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://d1qywhc7l90rsa.cloudfront.net/accounts/159013/images/version1-tag.png" style="width: 298px; height: 119px;" /></li>
</ol>
